# Citation metadata for Court Value.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Court Value scores, please cite it as below."
title: "Court Value (CV): a historically portable NBA/ABA player-season value metric"
type: dataset
version: 2.1.1
authors:
  - given-names: Mario
    family-names: Tavolieri
    name-suffix: III
abstract: >-
  Court Value (CV) rates every NBA (1952–present) and ABA (1968–1976) player-season on one
  historically portable scale. Version 2.1 publishes one season score combining the regular
  season (RS) and the postseason (PO), with both parts shown, and a Career CV. It measures realized season value
  and responsibility; it is not a causal impact or wins-above-replacement estimate. From version
  2.0 the formula is proprietary; scores are CC BY 4.0.
keywords:
  - basketball
  - NBA
  - ABA
  - Court Value
  - player evaluation
  - sports analytics
license: CC-BY-4.0
# CC-BY-4.0 covers the CV scores and documentation. The formula is proprietary.
date-released: "2026-09-30"
url: "https://mariotavoiii.github.io/Court-Value/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mariotavoiii/Court-Value"
identifiers:
